<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Booking Tree educator partnership</title>
<style>@media only screen and (max-width:540px){.email-padding{padding:20px !important}.outer-padding{padding:12px !important}}</style></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f8f4;color:#1e293b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#f2f8f4;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">A referral partnership for your students, with {{ $commissionPercent }}% commission for {{ $commissionMonths }} months.</div>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;background:#f2f8f4;"><tr><td class="outer-padding" align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
  <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;max-width:520px;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dce9df;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;">
    <tr><td class="email-padding" style="padding:20px 24px;background:#0b7a50;color:#ffffff;">
      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
        <td style="width:58px;padding:0 10px 0 0;vertical-align:middle;"><img src="{{ $logoUrl }}" width="50" height="50" alt="Booking Tree logo" style="display:block;width:50px;height:50px;border:0;"></td>
        <td style="vertical-align:middle;color:#ffffff;">
          <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;">Booking Tree</div>
          <div style="margin-top:4px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.3px;line-height:1.4;color:#d8f4e5;">EDUCATOR PARTNERSHIPS</div>
        </td>
      </tr></table>
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td class="email-padding" style="padding:24px;color:#334155;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:break-word;">
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 18px;color:#123b2c;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;">A partnership for your graduates</h1>
      <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">Hi there,</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">I’m Shane from Booking Tree, and I wanted to share a partnership idea for students completing your {{ $courseType }} courses.</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">As your graduates start taking on clients, Booking Tree can help them accept online bookings, collect payments and send appointment reminders.</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">The idea is simple: recommend Booking Tree to your students when they finish their course, and <strong>earn {{ $commissionPercent }}% of each referred student’s subscription for their first {{ $commissionMonths }} months</strong>, while they remain a paying customer.</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">There’s no cost to take part, and we would provide a dedicated referral link so you receive credit for the students you introduce.</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">Would you be interested in seeing how this could work for {{ $providerName }}?</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 18px;"><a href="{{ $partnerEnquiryUrl }}" style="color:#0b7a50;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">View the programme and enquire</a></p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Thanks,<br><strong>Shane</strong><br>Booking Tree</p>
      <p style="margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;">If this isn’t relevant, just let me know and I won’t follow up.</p>
    </td></tr>
  </table>
</td></tr></table>
<img src="{{ $trackingUrl }}" width="1" height="1" alt="" style="display:block;width:1px;height:1px;border:0;">
</body></html>
